---
title: Strawberry Preserves
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Pickles & Jams
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@fresh strawberries{5%c} (washed)
@sugar{6%c}

Put sugar on strawberries and let sit overnight. Drain juice and cook juice for 5 minutes. Drop in berries and cook 5 minutes longer. Remove from stove and let cool. Put in sterilized jars.
